  <DataPropertyAssertion><DataProperty abbreviatedIRI="kt:description"/><NamedIndividual abbreviatedIRI="kt:owllink-server-sat"/><Literal>Live OWLlink server: the runner starts 'owllinkserver' on a free port, posts the request file and evaluates the HTTP response.</Literal></DataPropertyAssertion>
